# Host test run artefacts. tools/sstv_host_tests.sh writes its build and run
# logs, its summary and its decoded PPM frames into the repository root, and
# the SDIO/Wi-Fi host tests configure their own build trees there. Running a
# test should not leave 50 files for the next `git add -A` to pick up.
/sstv-*.log
/sstv-*.ppm
/sstv-*.pgm
# tools/test-sd-storage.sh, added upstream in v0.5.0-beta.1, does the same.
/sd-storage-*.log
/apps/orcsdr-tab5/build-sdio-credit-host/
/apps/orcsdr-tab5/build-wifi-reconnect-host/
